en="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Preference: remembering settings such as display preferences. Set only after you accept them.</li><li class="flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>Analytics: aggregated, privacy-respecting measurement of page performance and navigation. Set only with your consent.</li></ul></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">What we do not do</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">We do not use advertising cookies, cross-site tracking pixels or third-party marketing tags. We do not build advertising profiles, and we do not share cookie-derived data with advertising networks.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Retention</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Session cookies expire when you close your browser. Preference cookies persist for up to twelve months. Analytics cookies persist for up to thirteen months and are then deleted or renewed with fresh consent.</p></section><section class="mt-10"><h2 class="text-2xl leading-snug">Managing cookies</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">You can withdraw or change consent at any time through the cookie settings link in the site footer of the application, or by clearing cookies in your browser. All major browsers allow you to block or delete cookies, though blocking strictly necessary cookies will prevent parts of the service from working.</p><p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">If you have questions about our use of cookies, contact hello@pawlogictech.com.</p></section></div></div></section><script>(function(a,f){let l;try{l=JSON.parse(sessionStorage.getItem(a)||"{}")}catch{return}const n=l?.[f||history.state?.__TSR_key];let c=!1;for(const t in n){const e=n[t],o=e?.scrollX,s=e?.scrollY;if(Number.isFinite(o)&&Number.isFinit